        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF141 supports the <code class=\"notranslate\">source</code> option to <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/showPopover\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">HTMLElement.showPopover()</code></a> and <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/togglePopover\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">HTMLElement.togglePopover()</code></a>, and the <code class=\"notranslate\">force</code> option to  <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/togglePopover\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">HTMLElement.togglePopover()</code></a> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1936411\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1936411</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds the features.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3166061913\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40027\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40027/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40027\">mdn/content#40027</a></p>",
